#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# Everything text is LF in the repo and on every checkout. Without this, a
# checkout on Windows produced CRLF working copies, and moving the tree to
# Linux made six untouched core/ files show as wholly modified.
*               text=auto eol=lf

# Linux start script should use lf
/gradlew        text eol=lf

# These are Windows script files and should use crlf
*.bat           text eol=crlf

